Bulbapedia Biology sections

Champdex shows the Biology section from a Pokémon's Bulbapedia article on
the catalogue page for that Pokémon. The text is fetched from
https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/w/api.php when the page is opened and
cached in data/bulbapedia/biology.json. It is not spoken on Yoto cards.

Bulbapedia text is Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 2.5.
Credit: https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/
Non-commercial use. Share adaptations under the same license.

Cache format (data/bulbapedia/biology.json), one object keyed by national dex id:
{
  "1": {
    "name": "Bulbasaur",
    "page": "Bulbasaur_(Pokémon)",
    "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Bulbasaur_(Pok%C3%A9mon)",
    "status": "ready",
    "blocks": [{ "kind": "paragraph", "text": "..." }],
    "fetchedAt": "2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
status is "ready" or "missing". The file is created on this computer and is not a dump of every article.
